@startuml cgms_sensor_state
title CGMS Sensor Lifecycle State Machine (Single-Use Sensor)

[*] --> Manufacturing

Manufacturing --> Stored : packaged
Stored --> Activated : user applies sensor
Activated --> WarmUp : power on

WarmUp --> Measuring : stabilization complete

Measuring --> Measuring : periodic sample

Measuring --> InternalCalibration : system recalibration needed
InternalCalibration --> Measuring : calibration successful
InternalCalibration --> DiagnosticsRunning : calibration anomaly

Measuring --> DiagnosticsRunning : signal anomaly detected

DiagnosticsRunning --> Measuring : issue resolved
DiagnosticsRunning --> Fault : fault confirmed

Fault --> Expired : unrecoverable fault

Measuring --> Expired : wear-time exceeded
Measuring --> Expired : battery exhausted

Expired --> Shutdown
Shutdown --> [*]

note right of Measuring
Normal operation:
- Valid glucose + trend
- Sampling every 1–5 minutes
end note

note right of InternalCalibration
Factory-calibrated system
No user intervention
end note

note right of DiagnosticsRunning
Transient evaluation:
- Signal quality
- Sensor health
end note

note right of Fault
Confirmed failure:
- User notified
- Glucose marked invalid
end note

note right of Expired
End of sensor life:
- Data invalid
- Replacement required
end note

@enduml
